{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"\"But then again, i don't dream either... I don't eat, I don't drink, I dont breather, I dont sleep...and I dont age either...\" That last part hits him hard","created_at":"2020-08-10T18:48:09.398000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742454258661851136","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"Leaf somehow looks relieved at this. Her face softens and she moves to place her small green hand against his. \"Rock... When my friends started having weddings, I was happy for them, but I was also a bit sad because... I just never thought I'd have one of my own. I never thought anyone would- with these-\" she gestures to her small frame, her jagged teeth, green ears and slightly clawed hands. She looks sad for a moment before her eyes brighten \"But then you asked! And that's how I knew you didn't care about that stuff. That's how I knew we'd be together forever. We were both worried about the same thing, but we both said yes.\"","created_at":"2020-08-10T18:52:44.577000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742455412845969478","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"\"But wren, she told me that.... Tha-....\" He pauses \"that THAT is the biggest reason to ask you... For me to stop living in my predictions of the future, and to live in the moment. To cherish what time I do have with you... Thats what gave me the courage to ask you.\"","created_at":"2020-08-10T18:52:46.507000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-10T18:53:34.881000Z","id":"742455420941238352","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
